  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving, equations&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi></math></p><p>Hence, Equation of the line is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> line of intersection of two planes is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math> (Let)</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b023f94c-3439-4939-a438-a476216b698d-c28a71a5-714a-4efb-b3ce-d26cd5911f9c-b8f147c3-526d-4572-b9c7-c7f336021e0c-1f0e54fa-3f3a-47a8-b0eb-14e7c17458f2-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 164px;\" /></p><p>It is clear from the diagram,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><msup><mo>&#8869;</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></math> to line&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>AP</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>34</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>21</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>102</mn></math></p>",
